---
name: code-review-session
description: Summarises a coding agent session and suggests improvements
inputs:
  - name: target_session
    kind: session
    description: ID of the session to review
    required: true
  - name: focus_area
    kind: string
    description: Review focus
    enumValues: [bugs, perf, style]
  - name: context
    kind: string
    description: Review context; when provided, it replaces the default instructions
    placeholder: Anything else the agent should know...
    required: false
---

# Code Review of session {{target_session}}

{% if focus_area %}
## Focus: {{ focus_area }}
{% endif %}

{% if context %}
{{context}}
{% else %}
## Instructions

Review the session's changes, focus on **{{focus_area}}** and report:
1. Issues found
2. Suggested improvements
3. Risks and trade-offs
{% endif %}
